// Windows resource script for crafter-sc: binds the application/window icon.
// IDI_APPICON (1) is the first icon, so Explorer and the taskbar use it for the exe.
// The .ico itself is a LOCAL, gitignored asset (see assets/.gitignore) — the clean-room
// source tree carries no image, and CMake only compiles this in when the .ico is present.
1 ICON "app_icon.ico"
